WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.953
The rotary washer and stone separator clean
whole potatoes before peeling.

00:00:05.023 --> 00:00:09.899
The pump circulates water, and a separate
instrument measures the resulting flow.

00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:15.487
Wire the wash flow transmitter to AI02 and wash
pump speed to AO02.

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:19.150
The speed demand alone does not establish
circulation.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.791
Set the training wash-water flow to 80 litres
per minute.

00:00:22.861 --> 00:00:25.960
Check the measured flow before allowing upstream
feed.

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:28.052
Inject the missing-flow fault.

00:00:28.121 --> 00:00:32.058
The transfer holds even if the pump still has a
speed request.

00:00:32.268 --> 00:00:35.420
Restore flow feedback and confirm circulation.

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:42.479
On the worked batch, 20 kilograms are removed
and 980 kilograms of washed potatoes continue.
